#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.radd:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to ``__radd__``, so ``other + lf`` is equivalent to "
"``lf.radd(other)``."
msgstr "绑定到 ``__radd__``，所以 ``other + lf`` 等价于 ``lf.radd(other)``。"

