msgstr "从左侧添加到 ``lf`` 每个元素的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.radd of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.radd:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with element-wise sum of ``other`` and ``lf``."
msgstr "包含 ``other`` 和 ``lf`` 元素级和的惰性框架。"

